  "description": "A dense cluster of black ants, appearing glossy and segmented, are shown in close-up. They are actively engaged in carrying what appear to be brown, elongated larvae or pupae. The ants are the primary visual focus, filling most of the frame, and their dark coloration contrasts with the lighter soil background. Their presence is central to the meme's visual metaphor, which equates them with Black people in a racially charged context.",
